ck-core-cde (2.5.3-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Modernize Debian/Ubuntu packaging for CK Core CDE 2.5.3 against matched
    CK Core Motif ABI 9 (`ck-core-motif9`) and `ck-core-fs-lib` (>= 0.3.0).
  * Split `ck-core-dtlogin` with `shared/default-x-display-manager` debconf
    and `pam_systemd.so` session integration.
  * Install `/usr/share/xsessions/cde.desktop` and
    `/usr/share/wayland-sessions/cde-wayland.desktop`.

